    "problem": "Frozen promptedLLMs reason verbally but lag supervisedVLN. NavGPT2 adds trained visualalignment and a learnedgraphpolicy while retaining optional linguisticgeneration. It uses discrete simulatorcandidates, not end-to-endphysicalnavigation.",
    "method": "§3: frozenEVA-CLIPViT-g/14 imagefeatures plus instruction-conditionedQ-former32queries∈R^(32×768) perview, linearprojectionintoFlanT5/Vicunahidden space. Prompt includescandidateangle andspecialimage/instruction delimiters. Stage1 instruction-tunesQ-former/projector on10KGPT4Vreasoningexamples sampled atreferencepathintermediatepoints, autoregressivetokenCE; LLM/vision frozen. Stage2 freezesVLM andtrainsDUETglobalbranch-stylepolicy: lastencoder(or decoder)hiddenimageandtextfeatures, MLPmerge32imagequeries perview, averagepoolnodeobservations,adddirection/visitstepembeddings. Crossattentiontoinstruction then graphselfattention softmax(QKᵀ/√d+A(E))V (Eq2; A islearnedspatialaffinity overpairwisedistances). GlobalFFNscoresallobservedfrontiersplusStop; visitednodesmasked; shortestgraphpathmovesagenttochosenfrontier. BC andDAgger CE lossesL=λL_BC+L_DAG(Eq3), withon-policyshortest-goal pseudoexpert. Stage1AdamW200Ksteps batch8lr1e−5,wd.05;stage2batch2lr1e−5; singleA100; bestusesPREVALENTsyntheticdata. Actionpolicy consumeslatentfeatures, notnecessarilygeneratedrationale text; optionalreasoningdoesnotguaranteeexplanationfaithfulness.",
    "novelty": "Directly exposesfrozenLLMvisual-language latents to a specializedgraphpolicy, rather thanchoosing actionssolely throughtext. This is explicitly DUETglobalbranch-derived, outside neitherDUETlineage nortrain-freecategory. ThelargeLLMisfrozenbutQ-formerandpolicyaretrained.",
    "results": "Table1 FlanT5XXLencoder5B+PREVALENT72SR/61SPLunseen,71/60test versusDUET72/60,69/59; R2R-only71/60. DUETwithoutlocalbranch68/59. ScaleVLN79/70hasmoredata. Supportsclosinggap atsimilar navigationdatascale, notbestlarge-data performance. Reasoningdata10K aloneisnot totalnavigationtrainingdata. Architecture-stagefreezing limitsmemory butfrozen5B+vision stillcostly.",
    "bottlenecks": [
